'' A 25,000-TERM '&' CHAIN COMPILES, as fbc's does (it takes 50,000). The old 12,000-operator
'' cap refused it, set where the 64 MB compile thread ran out; the thread now RESERVES 1 GB,
'' committed only as deep as the recursion goes (audit Phase 5).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/long-concat-chain.bas -o tests/codegen/longconcatchain.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/longconcatchain.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  25000
